@baseUrl = https://localhost:7135
@apiKey = REPLACE_FOR_DEMO

### 1. List upcoming performances (paged; optional ?category=Music&date=2026-12-31)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/performances?page=1&pageSize=5
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Performance details (404 if missing or not Upcoming)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/performances/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Create a reservation hold (201 new, 200 idempotent retry, 409 on conflict). Rate limited: 10/min per IP.
# Use a NEW GUID for each new hold; re-sending the same key + body returns the same hold with 200.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticketTypeId": 1,
  "quantity": 2,
  "idempotencyKey": "3f2b8c1e-7a4d-4e9b-9c55-0d1f6a2b7e10",
  "customerIdentifier": "demo@example.com"
}

###

### 4. Reservation status (use the holdId returned by step 3)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Confirm a reservation (200 { bookingReference }; 404 / 409 otherwise)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/1/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerIdentifier": "demo@example.com"
}

###

### 6. Booking details (use the bookingReference returned by step 5)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/SP-XXXXXXXX
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. Organizer: create an event (requires X-Api-Key; 401 without it)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/organizer/events
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "title": "Demo Event",
  "category": "Music",
  "description": "Created from the .http file",
  "venueId": 1,
  "organizerId": 1
}

###

### 8. Organizer: create a performance for an event (start must be in the future)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/organizer/performances
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "eventId": 1,
  "startDateTime": "2030-01-01T19:00:00Z"
}

###

### 9. Organizer: add a ticket type to a performance (Available is set to Capacity by the server)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/organizer/performances/1/tickettypes
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "name": "Balcony",
  "price": 40.00,
  "capacity": 60
}

###

### 10. Organizer: confirmed bookings and per-ticket-type summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/organizer/performances/1/bookings
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

###

### 11. Organizer: cancel a performance (200; 409 if it is already not Upcoming)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/organizer/performances/1/cancel
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

###
